# Keys whose signatures on evidence reports `urml evidence verify` trusts
# (RFC-0707). OpenSSH allowed-signers format, Ed25519 keys only:
#
#   <principal> namespaces="evidence-report@urml.dev"[,valid-after="YYYYMMDD"][,valid-before="YYYYMMDD"] <type> <base64>
#
# Only the Licensor's keys belong here. A retired key stays, with a
# valid-before date, so reports it signed keep verifying. Every change to
# this file is a reviewed commit: the history is the key's record.
#
# No Licensor key is published yet. Until one is, `urml evidence verify`
# reports that no key is available, and a signature cannot verify against
# the bundled file. See docs/evidence/signing.md.
